534
00:43:15,022 --> 00:43:15,898
Enjoy.

535
00:43:22,719 --> 00:43:26,055
<i>Don’t be so grumpy in the morning, Kierra.</i>
<i>Have a great day.</i>

536
00:43:44,927 --> 00:43:45,762
Sugar.

537
00:44:30,515 --> 00:44:33,893
<i>What is it about you that I can’t ignore?</i>

538
00:44:40,650 --> 00:44:43,569
- Hey! Surprise!
- Hello!

539
00:44:43,569 --> 00:44:45,404
Hi, Shan!

540
00:44:45,404 --> 00:44:47,615
Your interests have
really changed now, Shan.

541
00:44:47,615 --> 00:44:51,202
From parties and sleeping around—

542
00:44:51,244 --> 00:44:53,287
Don't waste your time on guys like me.

543
00:44:53,871 --> 00:44:54,794
Hey!

544
00:44:55,164 --> 00:44:58,251
You've been focusing on law
school now and this business.

545
00:44:59,370 --> 00:45:00,830
Good— Are you okay?

546
00:45:02,131 --> 00:45:03,758
I don't think you need some coffee.

547
00:45:04,482 --> 00:45:06,067
It looks like sleep is what you need.

548
00:45:06,092 --> 00:45:07,821
Of all the baristas I've met,

549
00:45:07,845 --> 00:45:10,146
you're the only one who
sticks your nose in my business.

550
00:45:12,380 --> 00:45:14,784
What if after our one-night stand,

551
00:45:14,809 --> 00:45:18,396
I ask you to go out on a date—

552
00:45:18,520 --> 00:45:19,404
with me?

553
00:45:20,822 --> 00:45:21,823
What would you say?

554
00:45:22,461 --> 00:45:25,005
Even without the one-night stand,
I wouldn't date you.

555
00:45:26,195 --> 00:45:28,497
Admit it, you're cheating on me.

556
00:45:28,522 --> 00:45:29,940
Didn't I tell you to stay away from him?

557
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:33,256
You're safe here, Kierra.

558
00:45:33,681 --> 00:45:35,183
Let's go somewhere else.
